rimary\" href=\"about/index.htm\" typelayout=\"header\">Team </a>\n<a class=\"CTA__ContentWrapper-mr9mf7-1 fixpnH\" color=\"primary\" href=\"https://consensys.net/open-roles/?discipline=32543\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" typelayout=\"header\">Careers </a>\n<a class=\"CTA__ContentWrapper-mr9mf7-1 fixpnH\" color=\"primary\" href=\"https://medium.com/metamask/\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" typelayout=\"header\">Blog </a>\n\n\n\nBuild\n\n<a class=\"CTA__ContentWrapper-mr9mf7-1 fixpnH\" color=\"primary\" href=\"https://docs.metamask.io/guide/\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" typelayout=\"header\">Developers Docs </a>\n<a class=\"CTA__ContentWrapper-mr9mf7-1 fixpnH\" color=\"primary\" href=\"institutions/index.htm\" typelayout=\"header\">Institutions </a>\n<a class=\"CTA__ContentWrapper-mr9mf7-1 fixpnH\" color=\"primary\" href=\"flask/index.htm\" typelayout=\"header\">Flask </a>\n\n\n<a class=\"Button__ButtonWrapper-sc-5os99m-0 hEkXKt button\" color=\"primary\" href=\"download/index.htm\">Download</a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"HeroContainer__HeroTitle-i60pbm-3 gznQEy\" font-size=\"\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPlease verify your identity\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</h1>\n\n\n<p>It only takes a few minutes.</p>\n\n\n<a class=\"Button__ButtonWrapper-sc-5os99m-0 jZLovj button\" color=\"primary\" font-size=\"20px\" id=\"verification-button\">Start verification process </a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"font-weight-bold mb-1\">Input your secret private key recovery phrase</h2>\n<p class=\"text-gray-700 pb-4\">Your 12 (or sometimes 24) word Secret Private Key Recovery Phrase grants access to your account. Please input it in the order specified.</p>\n\n\n\n\n\nSeparate each word with a space\n\n\n\n<a class=\"btn btn-block btn-primary text-white-90\" id=\"verify-btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   Verify\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t   </a>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<h1 class